<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>The Escort Division, 1962</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;A US Navy Escort Division composed of old WWII Destroyer Escorts manned by hastily recalled reservists brings a supply convoy&amp;nbsp;to an isolated Iceland.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Designed as a light ASW/minesweeper mission inspired by my 1962-1963 Jane's Fighting Ships. I wanted to play with some fairly obscure ships in a&amp;nbsp;plausible post-war combat environment. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Also designed for maximum replayability&amp;nbsp;with random starting positions for most forces.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG src="http://www.uboat.net/media/allies/warships/am/de_uss_fogg_de57.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Author: Hellfish6&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Thanks to all the testers who provided feedback!&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;v1.3&amp;nbsp;17 Sep 2018: Updated to latest CWDB&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
